# <destination, inside the skill>. A sandbox mandatory skill runs in every sandbox,
# agentless ones included, so it cannot count on an agent having imported another
# skill: it carries its own copy. (Guides from guides/ go in the `guides` manifest,
# as for any shared skill.)
